{"ID":"20240205153658-n7rvvtj","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153658-n7rvvtj","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153658-n7rvvtj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206114014-vvsz12j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205163516-3olbifh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206114014-vvsz12j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:136,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:136\u0026#125;","title":"苏木","type":"doc","updated":"20240902160927"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206114014-vvsz12j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206114014-vvsz12j","updated":"20240206114024"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于贵州、广东、广西、台湾等地。\n【性状】\t呈长圆柱形或对剖半圆柱形，长10100cm，直径312cm。表面黄红色至暗红色，可见红白相间的细条纹，具刀削痕和枝痕，常见纵向裂缓。横断面略具光泽，年轮明显，有的可见暗棕色、质松、带亮点的髓部。质坚硬。无臭，味徽涩。\n【性味】\t甘、咸，平。\n【功效】\t血祛瘀，消肿定痛。主妇人血滞经闭，痛经，产后瘀阻心腹痛，产后血晕，痈肿，跌打损伤，破伤风 。"}]},{"ID":"20240206114016-rzzqa9w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206114016-rzzqa9w","updated":"20240206114016"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206114016-6i2nw2a.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205163516-wn0vhxk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205163516-wn0vhxk","updated":"20240724095954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"苏木"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/苏木-20240205163516-bacspn9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205163516-3olbifh","Type":"Node